            <ArticleTitle>Clinical report on the use of specific TENS units.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1474-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This report provides information demonstrating that TENS can be effective in reducing pain after only a few applications and after short treatment periods. We have found our protocol on selection of TENS units and our treatment regimen to be effective for most of our patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
